    "bounding box" : [ 311.4, 329.106, 570.616, 408.354 ],
    "font" : "Helvetica",
    "font size" : 8.0,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 1.0]",
    "content" : "Involving undergraduate students in applied, hands-on research activities and projects is a primary focus of the College. College administration and faculty work diligently to provide students with abundant opportunities to engage in research under faculty supervision. Examples of each department's current areas of research are included in the department brochures and web pages. The Dean’s Office and corporate sponsors funds student-led research projects which are showcased in the annual Student Research Symposium."
